  "releaseNotes": "0.7.1: Usage analyzers and code fixes\n- Bundle JEV100 and JEV101 usage diagnostics with code fixes for lost backtick quoting and redundant explicit backticks.\n- Escape.Interpolated preserves arguments while returning a string. Its code fix simplifies qualification where safe and avoids shadowed local names.\n- Usage diagnostics recognize marker interfaces inherited through generic class constraints and chained type parameters.",
